    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that initializing an Earth system model with observed ocean conditions enables skillful decadal predictions of North Atlantic CO2 uptake up to 4\u20137 years in advance, attributing this predictability to an improved representation of the ocean's physical state.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
