            "paragraph": "The ocean component of MPI-ESM-LR use bipolar configuration, with one pole over Greenland and another over Antarctica... Jungclaus, J. H. et al. Characteristics of the ocean simulations in the Max Planck Institute Ocean Model (MPIOM) the ocean component of the MPI-Earth system model. J. Adv. Model. Earth Syst. 5, 422-446 (2013).",
