            "target_entity_instance": "bipolar configuration in ocean model",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "The ocean component of MPI-ESM-LR use bipolar configuration, with one pole over Greenland and another over Antarctica, so the resolution in the North Atlantic SPG region is from ~ 20 km in the north (65\u00b0 N) to ~70 km in the south (45\u00b0 N).",
