            "target_entity_instance": "uninitialized",
            "target_entity_type": "SimulationType",
            "paragraph": "For comparison, a set of uninitialized simulations is performed without any observations nudged. No carbon cycle observations are used in the assimilation run, so that the ocean biogeochemical processes perform as a passive component.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
