            "target_entity_instance": "correlation coefficient",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "The western SPG MLD and CO2 flux from our model [MPI-ESM] results are highly correlated (with a correlation coefficient of 0.78), and both are highly correlated (with correlation coefficients of 0.69 and 0.56, respectively) with the observed December- January-February-March (DJFM) NAO index.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "MPI-ESM",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
